me</li><li>{@link ReflectionConstant::getShortName} — Gets short name</li><li>{@link ReflectionConstant::getValue} — Gets value</li><li>{@link ReflectionConstant::isDeprecated} — Checks if deprecated</li><li>{@link ReflectionConstant::__toString} — Returns string representation</li></ul></div>
